From: mothershipOS
Subject: [PATCH] libhexagonrpc: honor default_library

mothershipOS links hexagonrpcd statically (-Ddefault_library=static): one self-contained daemon, no library next
to Ubuntu's libhexagonrpc package.

diff --git a/libhexagonrpc/meson.build b/libhexagonrpc/meson.build
--- a/libhexagonrpc/meson.build
+++ b/libhexagonrpc/meson.build
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-libhexagonrpc = shared_library('hexagonrpc',
+libhexagonrpc = library('hexagonrpc',
   'context.c',
   'fastrpc.c',
   'interfaces.c',
